# 16. Rule-Based Fallback Classifier

The system should still work without AI.

Example rules:

```text
"fire", "smoke", "burning" → fire
"flood", "water level", "overflow" → flood
"ambulance", "injured", "unconscious" → medical
"crash", "collision", "vehicle accident" → accident
"chemical", "factory", "gas leak" → industrial
"building collapsed", "collapse" → structural
```

Severity can use keywords:

```text
critical:
explosion, trapped, collapse, multiple casualties, spreading fire

high:
major fire, serious injury, heavy flooding

medium:
minor accident, localized flooding

low:
small incident, no injury
```

This is only a demo heuristic, not a real emergency decision system.

