# 18. Resource Recommendation Engine

A full optimization engine is unnecessary for the hackathon.

Use a deterministic scoring system.

## 18.1 Matching Factors

```text
Capability match  = 50%
Availability      = 25%
Distance           = 25%
```

Example:

```text
Fire Incident
      ↓
Required capability = fire_suppression
      ↓
Find available fire resources
      ↓
Calculate distance
      ↓
Rank resources
      ↓
Return top 3
```

## 18.2 Example Output

```json
[
  {
    "resourceId": "FT-04",
    "matchScore": 94,
    "distanceKm": 2.1,
    "etaMinutes": 6
  },
  {
    "resourceId": "FT-07",
    "matchScore": 81,
    "distanceKm": 4.8,
    "etaMinutes": 11
  }
]
```

