# 61. Free Deployment Reality

Free hosting is appropriate for a hackathon demo, but it is not equivalent to production emergency infrastructure.

For example, free Render web services can spin down after inactivity and may take time to wake up. Therefore:

- Do not claim guaranteed 99.9% uptime
- Do not claim production emergency-service reliability
- Keep a local demo environment ready
- Test deployment before presentation

