# 82. AI Failure Handling

If Gemini fails:

```text
Gemini API error
      ↓
Log error
      ↓
Run fallback classifier
      ↓
Continue incident workflow
```

The user should never see:

```text
"Gemini API failed"
```

as the only result.

Instead:

```text
AI unavailable — using automated fallback classification.
```

---

# 83. External API Failure Handling

For every external service:

```text
External service
      ↓
Success → use result
      ↓
Failure → fallback
```

Examples:

### OSRM fails

Use straight-line distance + approximate ETA.

### Cloudinary fails

Continue without image attachment.

### Gemini fails

Use rule-based classifier.

### OSM tile issue

Keep incident list and dashboard functional.

